  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Excellent. Though I hesitate to distract from your mission, I believe I've discovered a spell that might aid in your efforts.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_21.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "As you know, Mirage has a long and troubled history. There were times when the entire world was nearly wiped out.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_22.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Though such events were not pretty, there was power in them. To recreate one on a smaller scale could be helpful, but I lack one ingredient.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_23.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Bring me the Fossilized Locust Jar from the Old Mottoman Cave near Caravan, and then we shall together gain an advantage over our enemies.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_24.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh dear, why do you dally? There is much to be done and nothing to be discussed. Get the Fossilized Locust Jar and return.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_25.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
